From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Brooks <bass_rock@me.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 18:41:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] radv: advertise VK_KHR_unified_image_layouts from GFX10.3, as
 GENERAL is valid for every use

Stela's Metal device keeps every image in VK_IMAGE_LAYOUT_GENERAL and
requires unifiedImageLayouts. GENERAL is a valid layout for every use on every
generation; before GFX11 RADV may keep fewer images compressed in it, which
costs bandwidth, not correctness.
---
 src/amd/vulkan/radv_physical_device.c | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/amd/vulkan/radv_physical_device.c b/src/amd/vulkan/radv_physical_device.c
index f623cb04397dd740b37fee57d33439483718ab48..dbaa1f650569e62788573f57263cd89ca076aa14 100644
--- a/src/amd/vulkan/radv_physical_device.c
+++ b/src/amd/vulkan/radv_physical_device.c
@@ -815,7 +815,10 @@ radv_physical_device_get_supported_extensions(const struct radv_physical_device
 #endif
       .KHR_synchronization2 = true,
       .KHR_timeline_semaphore = pdev->info.has_timeline_syncobj,
-      .KHR_unified_image_layouts = pdev->info.gfx_level >= GFX11,
+      /* GENERAL is valid for every use on every generation; before GFX11 it can
+       * cost compression, never correctness. Stela's Metal device keeps every
+       * image in GENERAL and schedules no layout transitions. */
+      .KHR_unified_image_layouts = pdev->info.gfx_level >= GFX10_3,
       .KHR_uniform_buffer_standard_layout = true,
       .KHR_variable_pointers = true,
       .KHR_vertex_attribute_divisor = true,
